  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova wacu ni Harun kumae, In wuku woti man ot pa wuru karacelo kudi wubiyeyo kier mi kamaleng’: man in wuku woti karacelo kudi wubiyeyo kier mi lamulam mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man utumeru bende, ma suru pa Lawi, ma suru pa wuru kelgi ceng’ni karacelo kudi, kara giribri karacelo kudi, man gitim iri tim: ento in ku woti karacelo kudi wubibedo i wang’ hema mi lembatuca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man gibigwoko kur peri, ku kur mi Hema ceke: ento gibicoro ceng’ni agulu mi kamaleng’ man ba pemblam ungo, kara ku githo, kadok gin, kadi wun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gibiribri karacelo kudi, man gibigwoko kur mi hema mi cokri, mi giratima ceke mi Hema: man jawirok bibino ceng’ni wun ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E wubigwoko kur mi kamaleng’, man kur mi pemblam; kara kwinyo kud ubed kendo Wi nyithindho mir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man an, nen, agamu utumegwu ma Julawi kud i kind nyithindho mir Israel: gi giramia iwu, ma jumio ni Yehova, kara gitim giratima mi hema mi cokri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man in wuku woti karacelo kudi wubigwoko lamulam mu pi gin ceke mi pemblam, man pi maeno ma yo i kusikabongu; e wubitimo giratima: amio lamulam iwu calu giratima mi giramia: e jawirok m’ucoro ceng’ni jubinege.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova yero ni Harun kumae, Man an, nen, amio iri kur mi lam m’ating’a para, en e gin ceke ma leng’ mi nyithindho mir Israel; amiogi iri ni kum wir ma ku mo, man ni woti, calku makapiny mi nja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni bibedo peri mi gin ma leng’ m’usagu, m’uai kud i mac: girathiera migi kubang’e kubang’e, cil lam mi mogo migi kubang’e kubang’e, man lam mi dubo migi kubang’e kubang’e, man lam mi kier migi kubang’e kubang’e, ma gibithiero ira, bibedo leng’ m’usagu iri man ni woti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibicamu kume calu gin ma leng’ m’usagu; co ceke kubang’gi kubang’gi gibicamu kume: ebibedo leng’ iri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni peri: lam m’ating’a mi giramia migi, en e lam m’awira ceke mi nyithindho mir Israel; amiogi iri, man ni woti man ni nyigi karacelo kudi, calu makapiny mi nja; ku ba dhanu ceke m’i ot peri m’ubedo leng’ gibicamu kume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mo ceke ma ber, man nyingulok ceke ma ber, man nganu ceke ma ber, en e landu mwoka migi ma gimio ni Yehova, amiogi iri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Landu mwoka mi gin ceke mi ng’om migi, ma gikelo ba Yehova, bibedo peri; ku ba dhanu ceke m’e leng’ i ot peri bicamu kume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.27.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 27:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin ceke ma jukoyo i Israel, bibedo peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin ceke m’uyabu ic, mi ring’o ceke ma gibithiero ni Yehova, kadok mi dhanu kadi mi lim de bibedo peri: ento kayu mi dhanu ibiwaru andha, man kayu mi lim ma leng’ ungo ibiwaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeno ma jubiwaru m’i kindgi ugambre kum ma dwije acel ibiwaru, calku wel m’iketho, mi sente mi cekel abic, calku cekel mi kamaleng’ (ma en e gera pier ario). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento kayu mi dhiang’, kadi kayu mi rombo, kadi kayu mi diel, ibiwaru ngo; gin gi leng’: ibikixo rimbgi wi pemblam, man ibiwang’u mio migi ni lam ma jutimo ku mac, ni ng’wic mido ma ng’ar ni Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ring’gi bibedo peri, calu kor m’awira man calu bam ma yor acwic, ebibedo peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lam m’ating’a ceke mi gin ma leng’, ma nyithindho mir Israel uthiero ni Yehova, amio iri, ku woti man nyigi karacelo kudi, calu makapiny mi nja: en e lembariba mi kadu mi nja i wang’ Yehova iri man ni kodhini karacelo kudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova wacu ni Harun kumae, Ibibedo kud aba ngo i ng’om migi, kadok makapiny moko m’i kindgi de ibibedo ko ngo: an a makapiny peri man aba peri i kind nyithindho mir Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
